From f13326ba2ed162daaf5e4060ba87fa08a542fc2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex <05jeelo30@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:29:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add a network traffic speed indicator

Show the current internet up/download speed next to the clock. A
self-contained TextView sums TrafficStats across the active networks
every two seconds and follows the status bar tint. It reads its settings
from Settings.System, with no dependency on the Lineage/crDroid tuner
bridge:

- network_traffic_state   on/off
- network_traffic_mode     0 up+down, 1 up, 2 down
- network_traffic_autohide hide when idle
- network_traffic_units    0 bits, 1 bytes
- network_traffic_hidearrow hide the direction arrows

Based on OmniROM's and crDroid's NetworkTraffic.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QY97AsgNLyAwQpzrsxC9zt
